                                                    14 ***********************************************************************
                                                    15 *
                                                    16 *        basic instruction tests
                                                    17 *
                                                    18 ***********************************************************************
                                                    19 *  This program tests proper functioning of the Miscellaneous
                                                    20 *  Instruction Extensions facility 4 RRE Count Leading Zeros and
                                                    21 *  Count Trailing Zeros instructions.
                                                    22 *  Exceptions are not tested.
                                                    23 *
                                                    24 *  PLEASE NOTE that the tests are very SIMPLE TESTS designed to catch
                                                    25 *  obvious coding errors.  None of the tests are thorough.  They are
                                                    26 *  NOT designed to test all aspects of any of the instructions.
                                                    27 *
                                                    28 ***********************************************************************
                                                    29 *
                                                    30 *    *Testcase mie4-CLZG-CTZG
                                                    31 *    *
                                                    32 *    *   Miscellaneous-instruction-extensions facility 4 instruction
                                                    33 *    *   tests for RRE encoded:
                                                    34 *    *
                                                    35 *    *   B968  CLZG  - COUNT LEADING ZEROS
                                                    36 *    *   B969  CTZG  - COUNT TRAILING ZEROS
                                                    37 *    *
                                                    38 *    *   # ------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    39 *    *   #  This tests only the basic function of the instruction.
                                                    40 *    *   #  Exceptions are NOT tested.
                                                    41 *    *   # ------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    42 *    *
                                                    43 *    mainsize    2
                                                    44 *    numcpu      1
                                                    45 *    sysclear
                                                    46 *    archlvl     z/Arch
                                                    47 *
                                                    48 *    loadcore    "$(testpath)/mie4-CLZG-CTZG.core" 0x0
                                                    49 *
                                                    50 *    diag8cmd    enable    # (needed for messages to Hercules console)
                                                    51 *    runtest     5         #
                                                    52 *    diag8cmd    disable   # (reset back to default)
                                                    53 *
                                                    54 *    *Done
                                                    55 *
                                                    56 ***********************************************************************
