000003A0  4900 8298                     00000498   333 MSG      CH    R0,=H'0'               Do we even HAVE a message?
000003A4  07D2                                     334          BNHR  R2                     No, ignore

000003A6  9002 81DC                     000003DC   336          STM   R0,R2,MSGSAVE          Save registers

